  "body": "See yourself in this high level two bedroom apartment viewing the world\r\nbelow and around you.  Unfurnished but well tenanted if you want an investment.  Live here for the best of sea air and convenience to all facilities.\r\nA once only opportunity, don’t miss out!\r\n\r\n· Unfurnished\r\n· 79m2\r\n· Two Bedroom\r\n· 1 Bathroom\r\n· Level 11\r\n· Balcony, Great outlook\r\n· Full kitchen\r\n· 2 Secure Parks, Storage Unit\r\n· Facilities Pool, Hot Tub\r\nSauna\r\n\r\nOPEN HOME VIEWINGS\r\nWednesday 11am and Saturdays at 11am\r\nOr call us\r\n\r\nAsking $895,000\r\nCall Eric 021 702 224",
